<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Signs Australian jobs market improving-Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Signs Australian jobs market improving-Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Thursday new skilled vacancies data released earlier indicated the employment market was getting stronger.</p>
<p>&quot;This is yet another indication that the employment market may be getting stronger,&quot; Howard told Sydney radio 2GB.</p>
</text>
